-      "title": "Monitor WhatsApp message template quality and alert on pause/disable",
-      "priority": "high",
-      "description": "When Meta automatically pauses a template due to low quality rating (spam reports, low read rate), the bot silently fails to deliver proactive messages. A webhook listener and admin alert must detect template pauses before they escalate to permanent disable.",
-      "acceptanceCriteria": [
-        "Incoming `message_template_status_update` webhook events are parsed and persisted to a `template_quality_events` DB table with fields: template_name, old_status, new_status, reason, timestamp",
-        "When a template status changes to PAUSED or DISABLED, an admin WhatsApp notification is sent within 60 seconds including template name, new status, and pause duration",
-        "Admin dashboard shows current status and quality rating for each registered template",
-        "A daily summary of template quality ratings is included in the existing daily performance report",
-        "Webhook handler returns HTTP 200 within 5 seconds to avoid Meta retry storms"
-      ],
-      "technicalNotes": [
