-      "priority": "medium",
-      "description": "When staff or automated workflows send media via `sendWhatsAppMedia`, there is no pre-send validation. Sending an oversized video (>16MB) or unsupported MIME type silently fails at the WhatsApp level with no actionable error surfaced to the admin.",
-      "acceptanceCriteria": [
-        "Before sending, validate MIME type against WhatsApp-supported list: JPEG/PNG (images ≤5MB), MP4 (video ≤16MB, H.264+AAC only), AAC/MP3/OGG/AMR (audio ≤16MB), PDF/DOCX/XLSX (documents ≤100MB)",
