-        "ORDERING intent: item requests captured and added to cart, no submission yet",
-        "CONFIRM intent: order submitted to kitchen only after explicit guest confirmation",
-        "AI asks for confirmation before submitting: shows full order summary and Shall I place this order",
-        "Declining confirmation returns guest to ORDERING stage",
-        "Vitest unit tests for each intent transition"
-      ],
-      "technicalNotes": [
-        "Add ORDER_BROWSE, ORDER_ITEM_ADD, ORDER_CONFIRM, ORDER_DECLINE intents to routing.json",
